  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Artist's project, Apr. 1 to May 31, 1998, sponsored by the Philadelphia Museum of Art, recorded a journey across the United States with a group of Thai students and included an interactive web site; curated by John B. Ravenal and Ann Temkin.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Parts [1] and [2] of the passport-like books are fastened together and comprise sketches, maps, and materials from the project. Part [3] is a CD-ROM in slipcase which replicates the "On the road" website. System requirements for CD-ROM: Windows 95 or later or Macintosh OS 7 or later; CD-ROM drive; Netscape Navigator 3+ or Microsoft Internet Explorer 3+. To view video clips, a Pentium or PowerPC computer, 4X or faster CD-ROM drive, RealPlayer software version 5 or later are required.</subfield>
  </datafield>
